sinline preload='metadata'> <source type='video/mp4' src='/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/en-Animation_bot.mp4'/> </video> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_center_hor page__row_padd-top_m\"> <span> <a class=\"link color_gray_75 text \" target='_blank' href=\"/chatbots/\"> Learn more about chatbot </a> </span> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_5 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"grid grid_rows\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_10 grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_gray_90 nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>Combine all your messages into one all-inclusive app</div> <div class='text color color_gray_75'>Let your customers contact you in a way that’s convenient for them. <br>Give your team the toolkit to provide quick and helpful responses. </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid page__row_padd-top_xs\" style='margin: 0 calc(var(--grid-gap)*-1) calc(var(--grid-gap)*-1)'> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='247'%20height='150'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/image02.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/image02@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"247\" height=\"150\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__col_gutter\"></div> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_green-2 grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h4 color_white nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_s'>65k+ live operators communicate with customers using <br>Jivo daily</div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid \"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='241'%20height='72'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/image03.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/image03@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"72\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section style=\"padding-top: calc(6*var(--grid-gap)); \" class=\"\"> <div class=\"grid grid_items grid_rows grid_wrap\"> <div class=\"nx-title nx-title_h3 nx-title_no-mrg_top home__blockquote\"> «Since Jivo chatbot integration, the number of leads has increased by 70%, and lead-to-deal conversion rate has increased by 15%. Now we do not miss a single message from customers even during <br>off-hours» </div> <div class=\"grid grid_center_vert\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='49'%20height='48'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/avatar01.webp\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/avatar01@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"48\"/> <div class=\"grid__col_gutter\"></div> <div class=\"text color_gray_60\"> Head of Customer Service, Renaissance Life </div> </div> </div> </section> <section style=\"padding-top: calc(6*var(--grid-gap)); \" class=\"\"> <div class=\"nx-title nx-title_h2 nx-title_no-mrg_top\"> Protect your business </div> <div class=\"text color_gray_75\"> Take control of the communication between your staff and customers. <br>Ex-employees and lost phones are no longer a cause for concern </div> <div class=\"grid grid_items grid_wrap page__row_padd-top_m page__row_padd-bottom_xs\"> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_6 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_10 nx-iblock_padd_no-bottom-all nx-iblock_padd_no-right-all grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"grid__col_14 grid__col_14_mobile\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_gray_90 nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>Bring all your contacts to a safe location</div> <div class='text color color_gray_75'>Store personal data in Jivo, not in your staff's phones</div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_grow grid_end_hor grid_end_vert page__row_padd-top_m\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='410'%20height='390'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/base01.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/base01@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"390\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_10 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_90 grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_white nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>No need to share passwords with staff</div> <div class='text color color_gray_35'>When a staff member gets access to your social media, you run the risk of losing access to your account if the employee is let go. Let your staff communicate to clients through Jivo app with no access to the actual social media account</div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_grow grid_center_hor grid_center_vert page__row_padd-top_m\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='615'%20height='339'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/base02.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/base02@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"615\" height=\"339\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"grid grid_items grid_wrap page__row_padd-bottom_l\"> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_9 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_10 nx-iblock_padd_no-bottom-all nx-iblock_padd_no-right-all grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"grid__col_14 grid__col_14_mobile\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_gray_90 nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>Take control of <br>the correspondence</div> <div class='text color color_gray_75'>Monitor the communication quality <br>by reviewing the saved dialogues</div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_grow grid_end_hor grid_end_vert page__row_padd-top_s\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='646'%20height='451'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/en-base03.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/en-base03@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"646\" height=\"451\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_7 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_10 grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_gray_90 nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>Social media and messenger accounts <br> are your property</div> <div class='text color color_gray_75'>It is easier to prevent client data leakage than to cover the damages after it takes place </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_grow grid_center_hor grid_center_vert page__row_padd-top_s\"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section style=\"padding-top: calc(6*var(--grid-gap)); \" class=\"\"> <div class=\"grid grid_items grid_rows grid_wrap\"> <div class=\"nx-title nx-title_h3 nx-title_no-mrg_top home__blockquote\"> «After switching our Instagram account to Jivo, the sales increased by 32% in the first month and the customer loyalty improved notably. At the same time, the access to the account is securely protected: our live operators respond to messages through the Jivo app, and only senior staff know the account passwords» </div> <div class=\"grid grid_center_vert\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='49'%20height='48'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/avatar02.webp\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/avatar02@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"48\"/> <div class=\"grid__col_gutter\"></div> <div class=\"text color_gray_60\"> Head of Internet Marketing, Avilon </div> </div> </div> </section> <section style=\"padding-top: calc(6*var(--grid-gap)); \" class=\"\"> <div class=\"nx-title nx-title_h2 nx-title_no-mrg_top\"> Upgrade the customer service quality </div> <div class=\"text text_no-mrg_bottom text_font-weight_normal color color_gray_60\"> Access the current statistics and analytics for each stage of the sales funnel </div> <div class=\"page__row_padd-top_m\"> <div class=\"grid grid_items grid_wrap\"> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_6 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_10 nx-iblock_padd_no-bottom-all nx-iblock_padd_no-right-all grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"grid__col_14 grid__col_14_mobile\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_gray_90 nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>Monitor the work <br> of your live operators</div> <div class='text color color_gray_75'>Review the response time, working hours, and employee activity <br> for KPI analysis</div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_grow grid_end_hor grid_end_vert page__row_padd-top_m\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='362'%20height='334'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/chart1.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/chart1@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"362\" height=\"334\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_10 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_10 nx-iblock_padd_no-bottom-all nx-iblock_padd_no-right-all grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"grid__col_14 grid__col_14_mobile\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_gray_90 nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>Review the leads’ sources</div> <div class='text color color_gray_75'>Analyze where the inquiries come from and which channel <br> is the most effective </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_grow grid_end_hor grid_end_vert page__row_padd-top_m\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='696'%20height='404'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/chart2.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/chart2@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"696\" height=\"404\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_10 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_10 nx-iblock_padd_no-bottom-all nx-iblock_padd_no-right-all grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"grid__col_14 grid__col_14_mobile\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_gray_90 nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>Quality of service</div> <div class='text color color_gray_75'>Consider your customers' feedback to maintain <br> a high level of service</div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_grow grid_end_hor grid_end_vert page__row_padd-top_m\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='725'%20height='405'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/chart3.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/chart3@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"725\" height=\"405\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__item grid__col_6 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_gray_10 nx-iblock_padd_no-bottom-all nx-iblock_padd_no-right-all grid grid_rows grid_high\"> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"grid__col_14 grid__col_14_mobile\"> <div class='nx-title color nx-title_h3 color_gray_90 nx-title_no-mrg_all page__row_padd-bottom_xs'>Sales funnels</div> <div class='text color color_gray_75'>Find the weak spots at each stage of the pipeline and optimize the entire workflow to ensure the sales growth</div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid grid_grow grid_end_hor grid_end_vert page__row_padd-top_m\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='318'%20height='324'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/chart4.webp\" class=\"grid__col_v_end\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/chart4@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"318\" height=\"324\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section style=\"padding-top: calc(6*var(--grid-gap)); \" class=\"\"> <div class=\"nx-title nx-title_h2 nx-title_no-mrg_all\"> We are trusted </div> <div class=\"page__row_padd-top_m grid grid_wrap grid_items\"> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_8 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile grid grid__item\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_light-blue\"> <div class=\"text text_weight_medium\"> Using Jivo chatbot, 90% of requests are now resolved automatically, and deal conversion rate increased by 15%. </div> <div class=\"page__row_mrg_s grid grid_center_vert\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='49'%20height='48'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/feedback_item01.webp\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/feedback_item01@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"48\"/> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_gutter\"></div> <div class=\"color color_gray_60 text text_small\"> Head of Customer Service, Renaissance Life </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_8 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile grid grid__item page__hidden-mobile\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_green-2 home__green-block\"> <div class=\"page__row_mrg_s grid grid_center_vert\"> <img src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/globe.svg\" class=\"grid__col_v_top\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\"/> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_gutter\"></div> <div> <div class=\"nx-title nx-title_h1 nx-title_no-mrg_all\"> <span class=\"home__counter-data\" id=\"dynamic_widgets_count\" data-component=\"Counter\" data-type=\"widget\"></span> </div> <div class=\"color color_gray_10 text\"> websites around the world use Jivo </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_8 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile grid grid__item\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_light-blue\"> <div class=\"text text_weight_medium\"> Thanks to Jivo, we can now easily contact our clients, and not disturb them with undesired calls. </div> <div class=\"page__row_mrg_s grid grid_center_vert\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='48'%20height='49'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/feedback_item02.webp\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/feedback_item02@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"49\"/> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_gutter\"></div> <div class=\"color color_gray_60 text text_small\"> Development Director, Peplos </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_8 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile grid grid__item\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_light-blue\"> <div class=\"text text_weight_medium\"> With Jivo, our operators now process more requests, since calls can only address one client’s need at a time, while with chats, the operators can communicate with up to 5 clients simultaneously. </div> <div class=\"page__row_mrg_s grid grid_center_vert\"> <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='48'%20height='49'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/feedback_item03.webp\" data-srcset=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/feedback_item03@2x.webp 2x\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"49\"/> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_gutter\"></div> <div class=\"color color_gray_60 text text_small\"> CPO InDriver </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_8 grid__col_16_tablet grid__col_16_mobile grid grid__item page__hidden-desktop\"> <div class=\"nx-iblock nx-iblock_padd_m nx-iblock_bg_green-2 home__green-block\"> <div class=\"page__row_mrg_s grid grid_center_vert\"> <img src=\"/assets/images/compressed/index-v2/globe.svg\" class=\"grid__col_v_top\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\"/> <div class=\"grid__col grid__col_gutter\"></div> <div> <div class=\"nx-title nx-title_h1 nx-title_no-mrg_all\"> <span class=\"home__counter-data\" id=\"dynamic_widgets_count\" data-component=\"Counter\" data-type=\"widget\"></span> </div> <div class=\"color color_gray_10 text\"> websites around the world use Jivo </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section style=\"padding-top: calc(6*var(--grid-gap)); padding-bottom: calc(6*var(--grid-gap)); \" class=\"\"> <div class=\"grid grid_rows \"> <div class=\"nx-title nx-title_h1 nx-title_no-mrg_bottom nx-title_align_center color color_gray_90 page__row_padd_xs\"> Try Jivo’s every solution </div> <div class=\"page__row_padd-top_s grid grid_center_hor\"> <span data-component=\"AnalyticsSender\" data-event-action=\"Click on the connect button\" data-event-category=\"/ home\" data-event-label=\"Click on the 2d connect button, in footer\"> <a class=\"nx-btn nx-btn_rounded_overall nx-btn_w_full-mobile \" target='_blank' href=\"#\" data-component='AppAuthLink' data-component-type='reg'> Get started </a> </span> </div> </div> </section> </div> <footer class=\"page-footer page-footer_home-v2-ru\"> <section class=\"page__